      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.Document class serves as the primary entry point for reading and writing documents, while the aspose.words_foss.light_document_model module provides an abstract representation used internally by readers and writers. It converts documents to and from DOCX, DOC, RTF, Markdown, and plain text formats, and can export to PDF using the aspose.words_foss.saving module."
